WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A printed color word can interfere with saying its ink color.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In a controlled study, a specific suggestion changed that interference for selected people.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
But the study was not a trial of a commercial meditation recording.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
A separate attention study involved three months of intensive practice—not an MP3 shortcut.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
A listening routine may be appealing. The advertised effects still require proof for that product.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Try a free twelve-minute baseline. Decide what the recording would add.
